Keyboard Render Kit 2 documentation — unofficial multi-language reader edition
===============================================================================

Short version: the documentation belongs to ImperfectLink, the translations and
the reader theme belong to E3e (MIT), and the bundled Sphinx assets keep their
own open-source licences. This repository is not affiliated with ImperfectLink
or with Blender.

一句话说明：文档内容版权归 ImperfectLink；翻译与阅读版主题由 E3e 制作（MIT）；
Sphinx 等第三方代码沿用各自的开源授权。本仓库与原作者及 Blender 官方无关。


1. Documentation content and images
-----------------------------------

The English documentation text, screenshots and other assets are
© 2022 ImperfectLink, all rights reserved. They were originally published at
https://keyboardrenderkit.readthedocs.io/ (Keyboard Render Kit 2 v2.0.1).

This repository contains an unofficial, non-commercial mirror of that content
with community translations added. Still screenshots (PNG/JPEG) are
re-encoded as WebP and scaled down to at most 2000 px wide for faster loading;
animated GIFs are unchanged. No ownership of the original content is claimed
here, and no additional rights to it are granted by this repository. All
rights remain with ImperfectLink. If the author asks for the mirror to be
changed or removed, it will be.


2. Translations and the reader theme
------------------------------------

© 2026 E3e <https://github.com/Ephem-eral>, released under the MIT licence:

  * the Simplified Chinese hand-proofread edition, the Traditional Chinese
    conversion, and the Japanese / Korean / Russian / German / French editions.
    German and French are machine-translated drafts with editorial fixes. RST
    structure is verified for every language, but none of the editions has had
    a full native-speaker review yet;
  * the reader theme and site assembly: page templates, reader.css,
    style-op.css and reader.js (navigation, quick-jump palette, Chinese and
    Korean search handling, light/dark modes and visual styles), and the
    language picker page.

MIT licence text:

